{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他总想退回安宁里护住那种生活，如今带着牵挂往前，行动也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"替它争取\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到自己正为那种生活出力，他心里敞亮起来，惦记它也让他更有劲往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里敞亮\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他开始留意自己怎么做，怕一味加把劲，反而磨掉刚找回的温柔。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"怀疑和疲惫过后，他想到那种生活，心里又有了最初相信它时的快乐，也知道自己未必总能这样高兴。\",\n      \"key\": \"最初相信\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道眼前的努力能不能改变那些妨碍那种生活的事，最后又能护住多少。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"真到了要付出代价的时候，他还是可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于松了口气，不再反复找理由证明自己该往前，想护住那种生活的心思仍很清楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"松了口气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留从想退回安宁护住旧愿，到带着牵挂向前的关键转变。用不争取也护不住珍惜之物的经历支撑行动理由，替换不成立的跨段箭头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留两种心意共同推动行动、依恋不再成为负担的变化，让他因惦记那种生活而更有劲，不再抽象宣布两边已经和解。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把如何坚持、什么不能轻易丢掉的抽象判断，改成他实际留意自己的做法，怕用力过头磨掉珍惜的温柔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回怀疑和疲惫之后，最初相信那种生活时的快乐重新回来，以及他不再把这份快乐视为理所当然。改为想到向往的生活而重新感到快乐，不暗示他曾经真正过上那种安宁。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留努力未必改变现实、最终能护住多少也没有把握的两层不确定性，避免反复总结结果未知。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来可能因代价疲惫、动摇和退缩的风险，用过去曾经硬撑到疲惫的经历支撑，不把它写成抽象的冲突声明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再反复为向前寻找证明的变化。补足松开紧绷、能够喘息，以及心里仍清楚想护住什么的心理过程，对应结尾的安静与清晰。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e94686a3-4095-4af1-bc58-cf4c4f0a5a17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012216432906Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.64, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:24:29.078557+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "84bfdf632f2955c27ce721c6976d3e84df33a0eb4876a3af7d7e280ed8fa609e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012216432906Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "86d9f2e1c3aa01095824aa0287cf9cc241333326dca0679dfb71637db28944bd"}}}
